  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9b465c32-09a8-503c-9c42-6579b718966d" activityNameId="59e9d5e7-d921-5d50-a7a9-39410f0d2d5a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Small hydropower plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Small hydropower plant
Average of three small hydropower plants. The lifetime is assumed to be around 80 years. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. Sources: Baumgartner &amp; Doka (1998), Konersmann &amp; Jean-Baptiste (2000). Supplemented with information from Axpo (2011).;
UUID: fb323e9e-53eb-3807-a009-940c95a607ff
The dataset describes the construction of an average small hydropower plant. It includes the materials used, the electricity and diesel consumed as well as the transports needed.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average small hydropower plant. The average efficiency is 0.82. Capacity of 0.18MW.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fb323e9e-53eb-3807-a009-940c95a607ff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
